@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-005 — Daily sessions and durable audit delivery
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-024, UC-025, UC-026

actor Staff
participant "Identity & Staff" as Identity
database "Identity DB" as IDB
participant "POI & Content" as POI
database "POI DB" as PDB
Staff -> Identity: Open / reopen / close daily session
Identity -> IDB: Enforce unique staff + VN date
IDB --> Identity: Current session
Identity --> Staff: Session state
opt Date crossed midnight
 Identity -> IDB: Enforce closed previous-day state at API
end
POI -> Identity: Check principal + open session
Identity --> POI: Current authorized context / error
alt Authorized
 POI -> PDB: Transaction: mutation + audit outbox
 loop While awake until acknowledged
  POI -> Identity: Deliver eventId + original actor/session/time
  alt Identity available
   Identity -> IDB: Deduplicate eventId and record audit
   Identity --> POI: Accepted / already accepted
   POI -> PDB: Mark delivered
  else Delivery fails
   POI -> PDB: Retain pending; backoff
  end
 end
else Locked / no open session / Identity unavailable
 POI --> Staff: Reject protected mutation
end
Staff -> Identity: Read audit
Identity -> IDB: Own scope or Manager all
Identity --> Staff: Authorized history

@enduml
